stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Expected
  Expected --> Received
  Received --> Available
  Available --> Reserved
  Reserved --> Available: Reservation released/expired
  Reserved --> Sold: Sale committed
  Available --> InTransfer
  InTransfer --> Available: Receiving branch accepts
  Available --> InRepair
  InRepair --> Available: Repair completed / quality passed
  InRepair --> Quarantined: Failed / investigation
  Sold --> Returned
  Returned --> Available: Inspected and approved
  Returned --> Quarantined: Inspection hold
  Quarantined --> Available: Authorized release
  Available --> WrittenOff
  WrittenOff --> [*]
